<title>USA: U.S. Defense Stockpile gets bids for nickel.</title>
<headline>U.S. Defense Stockpile gets bids for nickel.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile said Thursday it received bids from three companies to buy nickel from the Stockpile's inventory.</p>
<p>Considar Inc offered to buy 500,000 pounds of nickel for $3.07 per pound, Abby Metal Corp bid for 40,000 pounds at $3.1543 per pound, and Omnisource Corp bid for 40,000 pounds, at $3.1753 per pound.</p>
</text>
